From: BE6L source research
Subject: [DRAFT NOT ADMITTED] mt76 independent RX cache lease

Actual per-queue sidecar, closed native admission, no hardware ALL provider.
Retired WCIDs are never reused in a device epoch: capacity/reset restrictions.
CPU metadata cleanup is not a full void-remove/devres DMA ownership solution.

